  m_Text: you have to fly across the sea and pass through narrow obstacles. Tilt
    your phone left and right to turn the plane and fly through narrow gaps. The
    prompts on your device will help you find the right angle. The color of the rock
    you are flying over will indicate what angle you need. Over time the speed of
    your game will increase, you will need to be precise and fast to get as far as
    possible
